WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.104
Anyone can issue a token in a few minutes,

2
00:00:03.104 --> 00:00:06.120
so a token by itself says nothing about value.

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.201
Stablecoins try to be worth exactly one dollar.

4
00:00:09.201 --> 00:00:12.217
Money-backed ones rely on the issuing company,

5
00:00:12.217 --> 00:00:15.299
crypto-backed ones on collateral in a contract,

6
00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:19.102
algorithmic ones on a promise to swap for their own token.

7
00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:21.593
In May 2022 that is how UST collapsed,

8
00:00:21.593 --> 00:00:24.806
and tens of billions of dollars vanished with it.
